WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.467
FELICIA MARTINEZ: We're angry.

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.103
We're very angry.

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.704
And we want justice
for our kids.

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:07.440 line:8%
And for this to be
let out without us

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:11.411 line:14%
even being seen first?

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:15.614 line:8%
We're the parents that
lost our children.

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:17.850
We're supposed to
do this together

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:21.020
first, not for the world.

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:23.355
We're suffering, and I know
the world is suffering, too,

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:29.795
but these were our babies, our
babies that were taken from us.

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:35.701 line:8%
So to the person that
leaked it, screw you.

00:00:35.802 --> 00:00:40.439
Screw you, and that's coming
from me, Felicia Martinez,

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:41.707
from all of us.

00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:43.676 line:14%
Screw you.

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:45.711 line:8%
ANGEL GARZA: Who in the hell
do these people think they are?

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:49.615 line:8%
I don't care if you're a
DA, you're a spokesperson,

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.984 line:8%
you're a Councilman,
you're a Senator.

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:55.555 line:8%
Who do you think you are to
release footage like that

00:00:55.655 --> 00:01:00.493 line:8%
of our children who can't
even speak for themselves,

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:03.796 line:8%
but you want to go ahead
and air their final moments

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:05.698 line:14%
to the entire world?

00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:09.302 line:14%
What makes you think that's OK?

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:13.339 line:8%
The least you can do is have
some freaking decency for us.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.107 line:14%
That is unacceptable.

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:19.712 line:8%
NIKKI CROSS: We've been asking
DA for this video for a while,

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:23.516 line:8%
and she refused
to let us see it.

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:27.887
So once again, the world got
to see it before us, just

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:29.322
like the day of the
shooting when Governor

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:32.558
Abbott announced to you all
that our children were dead,

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:34.960
and we had no idea.

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:38.864
So it's like reliving
that day all over again.

00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:40.566
And I'm sick of it.

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:43.803
I'm tired of it, so tired.

